optional personal nit: would prefer all the cmd[0]s to be switched in the same "area", maybe something like:

```
switch cmd[0] {
   case "add":
     ....
   case "recommission", "decommission", ...:
     <handle parse node id, etc, or maybe put this entire section into a new function
     switch cmd[0] {
        case "recommission": // ....
      }
}

```

so we're upfront about all possible states and cmd[0] is in one place. also i anticipate `add` taking more arguments in future (i imagined at a later stage we might want this such that `\demo add` would take the same flags as `cockroach start`) and the len(cmd) != 2 check may need to be moved lower.
